            according to the given mode. Available methods are `"constant"`,
            `"nearest"`, `"wrap"` and `"reflect"`. Defaults to `"constant"`.
            - `"reflect"`: `(d c b a | a b c d | d c b a)`
                The input is extended by reflecting about the edge of the last
                pixel.
